#: playfield.cpp:231
msgid ""
"Your opponent is using pre-KDE4 version of KBattleship. Note that, according "
"to the rules enforced by old clients, ships cannot be placed adjacent to one "
"another."
msgstr ""
"O seu contrincante está a usar unha versión de KBattleship anterior á KDE4. "
"Lembre que de acordo ás regras vellas, os barcos non poden tocarse."

#: playfield.cpp:244
msgid "Enemy has shot. Shoot now!"
